<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 71.50-80.50; 700-800 lbs 70.50- 75.00. Holstein Large 2 600-700 lbs few 55.00; 700-800 lbs 55.50-60.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 63.00-69.50; 700-800 lbs 64.50-66.00. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 1,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
